			<span class="mk-doc-aside-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
				<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 1 7 7c0 2.4-1.2 4.5-3 5.7V17a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2.3C6.2 13.5 5 11.4 5 9a7 7 0 0 1 7-7Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75"/><path d="M9 21h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
			</span>
			<h3 class="mk-doc-aside-card__title">Quick tips</h3>
		</div>
		<div class="mk-doc-aside-card__body">
			<p class="mk-doc-aside-card__text">
				Điền <strong>Title</strong> và chọn <strong>Folder</strong> trước khi upload — dễ tìm lại sau này.
			</p>
			<p class="mk-doc-aside-card__text mk-doc-aside-card__text--muted">
